\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 49. Common Mistakes to Avoid\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 1. Using only raw punch data for payroll\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Raw punches often contain errors. Payroll should use approved processed attendance.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 2. No shift integration\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Attendance without shift comparison cannot correctly calculate late, early leave, or overtime.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 3. Weak correction control\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Manual corrections affect salary and must require approval and audit.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 4. No payroll cutoff lock\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 If attendance keeps changing during payroll, salary calculations become unstable.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 5. Not storing raw punches\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Always keep raw punch logs for audit.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 6. No device monitoring\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Biometric sync failures can create major payroll issues.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 7. No geofence validation for mobile attendance\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Mobile attendance without controls can be abused.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 8. Mixing leave and absence incorrectly\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Approved leave should not become absence.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 9. Not handling night shifts\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Cross-midnight shifts need special logic.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 10. No audit trail\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Attendance affects pay, so every change must be traceable.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
